cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated article and this repository."
title: "DERS reference implementation on MuJoCo/MJX"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gao
    given-names: Chenkai
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Mingcan
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-27
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/<org>/ders-mjx"
abstract: >
  Reference implementation of dual-execution simulation for contact-rich robot
  manipulation: the executed transition is always the hard MuJoCo/MJX step and
  the derivative comes from a separately relaxed backward model joined by a
  straight-through coupling. Includes the gradient estimators used as
  baselines, the experiment scripts and the analysis code.
